{"id":"hafmj3wmb8k09v2f5tlwtb15c","title":"酸菜腌制方法与东北饮食文化","originalTitle":"那方水土那方人20 . 七 食在当年（6）","summary":"东北酸菜是冬季重要蔬菜，腌制方法简单但需注意温度和压重。传统腌法包括晾晒脱水、加盐码缸、用石头压紧等步骤。酸菜缸中会漂浮一层白醭，不影响口感。现代市场上出现防腐剂，但传统腌法无需添加。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=3622817&do=blog&id=1560779"},"publishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":"2026-11-12T01:17:20.176Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-12T01:17:20.176Z","category":null,"tags":["研究成果"],"score":14,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}